( 10... Nxd5?!
{11.cxd5 b6 12.Ba3 and the pawn on d5 is White's with the bishop holding everything: the knight did White's work.}
) ( 10... e6?!
{11.Ne7+ Nxe7 12.Bxe7 Re8 13.Bd6 and the bishop has taken a second pawn and holds both.} )
( 10... Rd7?!
