{The knight steps back to let ...h4 come with the knight on g3 hit, and to go to g5 and f5. [%tags kingside-attack] [%plan ...h4 pushing the knight to h1, ...f5 with the pawn on e4 hit, and ...a6 with ...b5 on the other wing. The knight on e5 stays until f4 comes, and f4 loses e4.] [%line The main line: 7.Nge2 Nc6 8.d5 Ne5]}
( 12... h4!?
{Sound: 13.Nh1 h3 14.g4 and the pawn on h3 is a nuisance White can live with. The knight first keeps the pawn for a better moment.}
) ( 12... Bd7!?
{Sound and slow: 13.Rc1 b5 14.Nxb5 and the pawn has gone. The knight first.} ) *


