( 8... c6!?
{Sound: 9.d5 and the centre closes with the bishop on d3 well placed for it. The take keeps the open centre.}
) ( 8... Re8!? {Sound: 9.d5 and the same. The take first.} ) 9. Nxd4
{The knight takes back. [%weight 9]} 9... Re8
{The rook to e8, hitting e4 through the knight. [%tags open-centre]} ( 9... Nc5!?
{Sound: 10.Bc2 Re8 and the same. The rook first.} ) ( 9... Nxe4?
{10.Nxe4 and the knight has gone for a pawn: the rook was not on e8 yet.} ) 10. h3
{The pawn takes g4 from the knight. [%weight 8]} 10... Nc5
