( 11... Nfxe4? {12.Nxe4 Nxe4 13.Rxe4 and a knight has gone for a pawn.} ) ) 6... Nbd7
{The knight to d7, holding e5.} ( 6... Nc6?! {7.c3 e5 8.d5 and the knight is hit.} ) (
6... e5!?
{Sound: 7.dxe5 dxe5 8.e4 and the same shape with the knight still on b8. The knight first holds e5.}
) 7. e4 {The pawn to e4, and it is a Pirc shape. [%weight 8]} 7... e5
{The lever. [%tags e5-lever]} ( 7... c5!?
{Sound: 8.c3 and the pawn on d4 is held. The lever keeps the shape.} ) ( 7... Re8!?
{Sound: 8.c3 e5 and the same a move later.} ) 8. c3
{The pawn to c3, holding d4. [%weight 8]} 8... Re8
{The rook to e8, behind the lever. The pawn on e5 is held three times and White's bishop on d3 is in the way of the queen.}
